---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "Flower"
letter: "F"
anchor: "flower"
category: "general"
---

The harvested, dried bud of the female cannabis plant — the most common form of cannabis sold and consumed. Cannabis flower contains the highest concentration of trichomes (and therefore cannabinoids and terpenes) of any part of the plant. Used for smoking, vaping, and as the starting material for home infusions and extractions.
